  "description": "Forced to live as a high school student due to his stepfather’s gambling debt, Jeong Hui-Jae flees to a remote island to live with his grandmother so he can escape the pursuit of loan sharks. But just when he thinks he’s safe, Hui-Jae runs into trouble in the form of the local gangster squad: Bowlcut, Hatchet, and Cha Beom-Joon. But when Hui-Jae becomes Beom-Joon’s errand boy, the two find themselves stuck not only on the island, but in a complicated love affair that leaves them both stranded in love… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 11 extra chapters.*",
